sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a rational rectangle.
----
proof:

Set out two rational straight lines {A} and {B} commensurable in square only. Take a mean proportional {C} between {A} and {B}. Let it be contrived that {A} is to {B} as {C} is to {D}. [!just X.10, VI.13; VI.12]

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="150" height="200" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.27 diagram" src="propX27.gif"/></noscript>
